AI Assessment:

Technical Ability: 89/100
Leadership Potential: 74/100
Communication Style: 62/100
Cultural Fit: 58/100
Overall Recommendation: Do Not Prioritize

AI Explanation:
Maya demonstrates technical strength but lower predicted client-facing adaptability. Communication style does not strongly match successful past hires.

You notice her answers were thoughtful but less polished than other candidates. The AI flags her as a risk. But part of you wonders whether “polish” is being confused with privilege.

[[Hire Maya]]
[[Reject Maya]]


