Passage: Welcome to Fit Score

Subject: New Hiring Cycle Begins

You arrive at work to find a message from HR.

This year, all hiring decisions must be supported by HireVueX, our new AI-assisted hiring platform. The system analyzes resumes, interview transcripts, communication style, leadership signals, and cultural fit indicators.

The company says the system will make hiring faster, fairer, and more consistent.

But you know hiring has never been neutral. Human managers bring unconscious bias. AI systems learn from historical data. Both claim to measure merit. Both may simply reproduce power in different forms.

Today, four candidates are waiting.

Your goal: build the strongest team possible while making ethically responsible choices.

[[Begin Review]]
